flowchart TB
  User[Usuario demo] --> Shell[App shell - idioma - rutas]
  Shell --> Dashboard[DashboardView]
  Shell --> List[PurchasesView]
  Shell --> Form[PurchaseFormView - confirmacion]
  Shell --> Detail[PurchaseDetailView - PaymentHistory]
  Shell --> Payment[PaymentFormView - PaymentForm]
  Dashboard & List & Form & Detail & Payment --> Store[Workspace store]
  Form & Payment --> Rules[Domain validators - money cents - dates - attachments]
  Store --> Local[Local repository adapter]
  Local --> Rules
  Local --> Storage[(Browser localStorage - fictional data)]
  Store -. Sustitucion futura .-> HTTP[HTTP adapter ASP.NET API - previsto AV2]
